  {:id "bootstrap/native-carrier-header",
   :criterion-text
   "Bootstrap criterion bootstrap/native-carrier-header: Implement unary bootstrap-native-carrier-header only for compiler-artifact meta/JVM plans, returning exactly kind, metadata-present?, extent, metric, child0 and child1. Unknown or inaccessible observations return the six-slot unsupported header with unknown metrics nil. Check every operand and nested receiver by exact native class before native observation. Cover nil, Boolean, Character, Byte/Short/Integer/Long, String/Symbol/Keyword, the declared native maps/set/vector/List/Cons/SubVector and BigInt/BigInteger/Ratio/BigDecimal/Float/Double contours. Preserve the source's UTF16 spelling metrics, native null-name Boolean, integer absolute-magnitude bits, checked BigInt backing, separate Ratio numerator/denominator without GCD/printing, fixed Float/Double carrier widths and BigDecimal unscaled-bits plus widened signed scale. For PersistentArrayMap, require an available non-null even physical array and return length/2 before metadata/count; reject odd/null/inaccessible backing as unsupported, including a HashSet's backing map. Preserve TreeMap default-versus-foreign comparator identity without invoking it, List raw head/tail without forcing Cons, and SubVector raw backing/start/widened end-minus-start extent without backing methods. HashSet uses only the fixed checked impl field. Construct only the selected returned header, with no unconditional fallback tuple. Exercise wrong arity/context, foreign/spoofed classes or nested numeric/Keyword receivers, inaccessible/odd/null backing, comparator callbacks, metadata callbacks, Cons forcing and SubVector delegated methods. Unsupported results have unsupported kind and nil in all remaining slots, never zero for an unknown metric. Symbol child0 is false for a null name and true for an empty or other non-null name, with child1 nil. Metadata is only a native-class-checked presence Boolean and is never walked or returned; use no Number coercion, numeric normalization or equality. Require L2-BUILTIN-ARITY or L2-BUILTIN-ERROR without operand rendering as specified; unsupported observation never implies DATA illegality. No equality/hashing/rendering/traversal, general reflection, caller-selected fields, module opening, Unsafe, denial retry or security bypass is permitted. Fixed field-access denial stays sticky; its Delay/Atom/Field state caches only fixed infrastructure including denial, never DATA or DATA validity. Cold resolution and accessor initialization remain audited host mechanisms. Headers do not confer provenance, admission or child validity. Keep the ABI outside ordinary Core/C5 catalogs and authenticated-source admission, and invalidate affected seed fingerprints without renewing old migration evidence. Required outputs: six-slot result corpus for every declared native contour and numeric extrema; callback/non-forcing and exact-class negative reports; sticky-denial/physical-backing and arity/context diagnostic fixtures; seed TCB and ordinary-export exclusion records.",
